    "Well-known albums and singers alone aren't enough to interest me; the era, musical style and collection of familiar songs matter more today."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated choices of best-of albums and classic hits collections say more about what I want now than an occasional individual pop album.",
    "Within older hits, I currently favor melodic rock and folk-related listening over other styles, so an older hits collection can appeal without being my first choice."
  ],
